{"ts": 1791222340.113, "tool": "skill_create", "action": "allow", "ok": true, "blocked": false, "seconds": 0.0, "source": "agent", "args": "{\"description\": \"Breaks a main task into smaller, manageable sub-tasks and assigns them in TaskRabbit.\", \"content\": \"\\n# Break down tasks\\n## Step 1: Create calendar event for task planning using Google Calendar.\\n- [ ] Use the built-in calendar feature of your preferred project management tool to schedule time blocks for each step of the main task. \\n## Step 2: Open TaskRabbit app to break down tasks into subtasks.\\n- [ ] Log in or create an account on the TaskRabbit app if you haven't already done so. \\n- [ ] Navigate through your project's details and tap 'Add a new job' or similar button to start breaking it down into smaller, more manageable parts. \\n## Step 3: Assign each subtask an owner and deadline in Trello board.\\n- [ ] Use the built-in calendar feature of your preferred task management tool (e.g., Trello) to assign specific owners for these tasks based on their expertise or availability. Set deadlines accordingly. \\n## Step 4: Schedule weekly review meetings with team members via Zoom.\\n- [ ] Arrange a recurring meeting time in Google Calendar and invite all relevant stakeholders, including yourself and your team members. Use the built-in calendar feature of your preferred video conferencing tool (e.g., Zoom) to schedule these meetings. \\n## Step 5: Identify potential risks related to communication gaps, flag them immediately.\\n- [ ] Review any existing risk management plan or create a new one if necessary. Consider factors such as language barriers, time zone differences, and technical issues that could impact the project's success. Flag any identified risks for immediate attention. \\n## Step 6: Use Asana for task tracking and progress updates daily.\\n- [ ] Log in to your Asana account or create a new one if you haven't already done so. Navigate through the main dashboard, find the relevant project, and start breaking down tasks into sub-tasks as per the previous steps. \\n## Step 7: Set up reminders in Google Calendar for all deadlines within 3 days.\\n-"}
